{"`getBaseConditions` has two unreachable branches. `getAuthorizationConditions()` always returns a `Prisma.Sql` object (never null), so `authConditions` is always truthy. The `else if (filterConditions)` and `else` branches can never execute. Consider simplifying to just two cases: filter present or absent.": 0.5222957134246826, "Caching tests were deleted instead of being converted to the new `Prisma.sql` format. The service still has `cachedAuthConditions` / `cachedFilterConditions` fields and memoization logic that is now untested at the integration level. These tests are trivial to keep \u2014 they only verify `conditions1 === conditions2` across repeated calls and don't depend on the assertion format.": 0.7629938125610352}